# iMessage (BlueBubbles) 配置模板

```json
{
  "name": "imessage-bluebubbles",
  "description": "iMessage via BlueBubbles 配置模板",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "channel": "bluebubbles",
  "config": {
    "enabled": true,
    "url": "http://localhost:1234",
    "password": "${BLUEBUBBLES_PASSWORD}",
    "api_version": "v1"
  },
  "features": [
    "发送/接收 iMessage",
    "群聊支持",
    "图片/文件传输",
    "表情回复"
  ],
  "setupSteps": [
    "1. 下载并安装 BlueBubbles macOS 应用",
    "2. 配置 API 访问密码",
    "3. 设置Webhook回调（可选）",
    "4. 测试连接"
  ],
  "apiEndpoints": {
    "send_text": "/api/v1/message/text",
    "send_attachment": "/api/v1/message/attachment",
    "get_messages": "/api/v1/message/recent",
    "get_chats": "/api/v1/chat"
  },
  "notes": [
    "需要 macOS 设备运行 BlueBubbles",
    "需要 iMessage 登录",
    "不支持 Windows/Linux"
  ]
}
```

## 使用示例

```bash
# 发送消息
curl -X POST "http://localhost:1234/api/v1/message/text" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "password: your_password" \
  -d '{"recipient": "+1234567890", "message": "Hello"}'
```

## 文件位置
`templates/messaging/imessage.json`
